{
  "title": "1: al-Faatehah الفاتحة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسۡمِ اللهِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِ (1)\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَلۡحَمۡدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الۡعٰلَمِيۡنَۙ‏ (2)\nAL-HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENAR. \nAll praise is due to Allah, the Lord of the Worlds. \nالرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِۙ‏ (3)\nRAHMAANIR RAHEEM. \nThe Beneficent, the Merciful. \nمٰلِكِ يَوۡمِ الدِّيۡنِؕ‏ (4)\nMAALEKE YAUMID DEEN. \nMaster of the Day of Judgment. \nاِيَّاكَ نَعۡبُدُ وَاِيَّاكَ نَسۡتَعِيۡنُؕ‏ (5)\nIYYAAKA NA’BODO WA IYYAAKA NASTA-E’EN. \nThee do we serve and Thee do we beseech for help. \nاِهۡدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الۡمُسۡتَقِيۡمَۙ‏ (6)\nEHDENAS SERAATAL MUSTAQEEM. \nKeep us on the right path. \nصِرَاطَ الَّذِيۡنَ اَنۡعَمۡتَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ ۙ‏ غَيۡرِ الۡمَغۡضُوۡبِ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَلَا الضَّآلِّيۡنَ‏ (7)\nSERAATAL LAZEENA AN-A’MTA A’LAYHIM, GHAYRIL MAGHZOOBE A’LAYHIM WA LAZ-ZAAALLEEN.\nThe path of those upon whom Thou hast bestowed favors. Not (the path) of those upon whom Thy wrath is brought down, nor of those who go astray. ",
  "merits": "Surah al-Fatihah is a cure for physical and also spiritual ailments. Without this Surah, even the daily prayers are incomplete. It is indeed a great treasure that has been given to us by Allah (s.w.t.) through the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and no previous prophet has been given anything like it. This Surah is also known as ‘Ummul Kitab’ and ‘Sab’a Masaani’."
}
